      "created_at": "2022-07-06T16:26:31.542Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Woot, my Chrono-Ranger question made it!</p>\n<p>Anyway, this was a cool episode, and I enjoyed the twists and turns. I find myself wondering if the Sliver of Creation was ever revised to be a shard of a Singular Entity - either Archaeon, or something progenitor of the other Singulars.</p>",
